# data-team Conventions

data-team does not opt into any global steering; these conventions are standalone.

- `javadev` owns warehouse-facing (Snowflake) changes; `godev` owns the build pipeline.
- Both agents share the `sql-helper` skill and this team's hooks/prompts.
- Never commit a real warehouse credential; use the SOPS-based secret flow documented in the repository's docs/secrets.md.
